irst person driving shots maybe  selfie stick outside of the car stuff  things like that but go ahead and  subscribe over there if you want to see  that stuff i'll have a link below to the  channel also have a link below to the  camera itself and thanks again to  insta360 for sponsoring this look but  that's pretty much been it thanks for  watching  and i'll catch you guys in the next one  peace  [Music]  [Music]  [Music]
 

